WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.498
Mɔgɔw tun b'a fɔra fana ko ni mɔgɔ min ye jigɛw tɔɔrɔ, o tigi n'a ka denbayamɔgɔw bɛɛ bena halaki.

00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:13.451
O b'a to denmisɛnw be bonya la u bamuso n'u somɔgɔw kan kabi u denmisɛn tuma.

00:00:13.531 --> 00:00:17.317
Hali bi, mɔgɔ dɔw be yɛlɛla kuluw kan ka taga yen.

00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:23.890
A b'u hakili jigi ko k'u tanga jii ma, o kɔrɔ ko ka bonya la an kan minw kɔnna an ɲa.
